  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">各院系：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">         <span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">为保证</font><font face=\"宋体\">2026年6月本科毕（结）业生的档案能够及时、准确地发送到用人单位，请各院系做好相关工作，及时将本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交至档案馆。相关安排如下：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">一、归档材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-left:28px; text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">毕业生登记表、成绩单、毕（结）业证书和学位证书复印件等（详见</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">清单）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">二、移交程序</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">1. 整理材料：归档材料应填写完整并加盖公章。每个人的材料放在一起，夹在毕业生登记表内。证书复印件复印说明见</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">2</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">2. 材料排序：按照学号</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">从小到大</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">的顺序排列。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">3. 填写清单：填写档案材料移交清单见</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">1</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">4. 移交档案：各院系核实无误后，将整理好的档案材料与纸质清单一并送交档案馆，纸质清单超过一页的须装订成册，防止散落遗失。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">电子版清单发至教务处（</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">weideng</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">@tsinghua.edu.cn）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">和</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">档案馆</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">qhdag@tsinghua.edu.cn</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">，邮件标题为“院系名称+2026年6月本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交清单+移交日期”。</font></span></span></span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">电子版清单确保与纸质材料同步报送。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">三、注意事项：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">1. 港澳台学生档案材料与统招生一并移交档案馆；国际本科生的毕业材料不移交。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">2. 党员材料按党委组织部统一要求整理和移交。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">3. 结业补行毕业学生的档案材料按照</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">3</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">要求归档。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">4. 国内深造毕业生拟就读学校开具的</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">调档函不再需要移交纸质版，</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">由学生本人按照学生职业发展中心要求填写上传。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">5. 自2026年6月1日起，档案转递方式由机要通道调整为</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">中国邮政速递物流（</font><font face=\"宋体\">EMS）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">，详见</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=route488f922a4a084e7f901b15b05208255a\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"text-underline:single\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">档案馆相关通知</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></u></a><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#0000ff\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">四、移交时间和地址：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">1. 移交时间：截至</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">2026年7月3日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">。因档案转递工作程序严格，为保证毕（结）业生档案的按时发送，请各单位将相关材料尽早移交档案馆。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">2. </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">移交地址与接收人：</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">档案馆</font><font face=\"宋体\">215房间，</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">田宁宁</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">（</font><font face=\"宋体\">627</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">97880</font></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">五、联系人和联系方式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">教务处：邓伟（</font><font face=\"宋体\">62780821）</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:left\"> </p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">1：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href=\"/f/info/route?id=routeae1573ff3ded484e8d2f928a2a00dd13\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交清单</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></a></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">2：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">毕业证书、学位证书复印件复印说明</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:21.0000pt; text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span class=\"15\" style=\"font-size:10.5000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"宋体\">附件</font><font face=\"宋体\">3：结业补行毕业学生档案材料归档事宜</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">                              </font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-indent:0.0000pt; text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">清华大学教务处</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"text-align:right\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"text-autospace:ideograph-numeric\"><span style=\"line-height:20.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">         202</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">6</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">年</font><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">6月</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">22</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0000pt\"><span style=\"background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:方正公文小标宋\"><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.0000pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal\"><span style=\"font-style:normal\"><font face=\"方正公文小标宋\">日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p> \n</div>",
  "contentText": "各院系： 为保证 2026年6月本科毕（结）业生的档案能够及时、准确地发送到用人单位，请各院系做好相关工作，及时将本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交至档案馆。相关安排如下： 一、归档材料 毕业生登记表、成绩单、毕（结）业证书和学位证书复印件等（详见 附件 1 清单） 。 二、移交程序 1. 整理材料：归档材料应填写完整并加盖公章。每个人的材料放在一起，夹在毕业生登记表内。证书复印件复印说明见 附件 2 。 2. 材料排序：按照学号 从小到大 的顺序排列。 3. 填写清单：填写档案材料移交清单见 附件 1 。 4. 移交档案：各院系核实无误后，将整理好的档案材料与纸质清单一并送交档案馆，纸质清单超过一页的须装订成册，防止散落遗失。 电子版清单发至教务处（ weideng @tsinghua.edu.cn） 和 档案馆 （ qhdag@tsinghua.edu.cn ） ，邮件标题为“院系名称+2026年6月本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交清单+移交日期”。 电子版清单确保与纸质材料同步报送。 三、注意事项： 1. 港澳台学生档案材料与统招生一并移交档案馆；国际本科生的毕业材料不移交。 2. 党员材料按党委组织部统一要求整理和移交。 3. 结业补行毕业学生的档案材料按照 附件 3 要求归档。 4. 国内深造毕业生拟就读学校开具的 调档函不再需要移交纸质版， 由学生本人按照学生职业发展中心要求填写上传。 5. 自2026年6月1日起，档案转递方式由机要通道调整为 中国邮政速递物流（ EMS） ，详见 档案馆相关通知 。 四、移交时间和地址： 1. 移交时间：截至 2026年7月3日 。因档案转递工作程序严格，为保证毕（结）业生档案的按时发送，请各单位将相关材料尽早移交档案馆。 2. 移交地址与接收人： 档案馆 215房间， 田宁宁 （ 627 97880 ） 五、联系人和联系方式 教务处：邓伟（ 62780821） 附件 1： 本科毕（结）业生档案材料移交清单 附件 2： 毕业证书、学位证书复印件复印说明 附件 3：结业补行毕业学生档案材料归档事宜 清华大学教务处 202 6 年 6月 22 日",
